00:00:53.829 --> 00:00:58.989
First, we speculated maybe Donald Trump doesn't
really make nearly as much money as he claims

00:00:58.989 --> 00:01:06.799
to and or although tax returns wouldn't necessarily
show net worth, they would suggest that the

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:09.999
