00:01:09.999 --> 00:01:11.909
This could be a blow to Trump's ego.

00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:16.509
Trump is obsessed with status and how he's
perceived and wants to be seen as rich and

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:17.719
all of this stuff.

00:01:17.719 --> 00:01:19.380
That's one possibility.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:25.389
The other possibility we speculated about
was that there would be liabilities or um,

00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:31.479
uh, uh, entanglements exposed by his tax returns
