00:01:31.479 --> 00:01:34.249
One was, he's in huge debt to Russia.

00:01:34.249 --> 00:01:35.849
He took money from Russia.

00:01:35.849 --> 00:01:42.090
He's way more tied in with Russia, uh, than
he has admitted that may be at this point,

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:45.909
if that went public, I don't know that it
would really be very damaging to Trump.

00:01:45.909 --> 00:01:51.689
It might be embarrassing to some degree, but
the Republican party at this point has a completely

00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:56.130
