00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.009
Anytime Russia comes up, it's a witch hunt.

00:01:59.009 --> 00:02:00.119
It was a hoax, whatever.

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:03.520
I actually don't think it would even be that
damaging if that was revealed, but that's

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:07.099
another possibility for what's in Donald Trump's
taxes.

00:02:07.099 --> 00:02:14.610
The other possibility is that there will be
discrepancies, um, uh, made, made public between

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:21.840
Donald Trump's, um, uh, private claims or
claims for lending purposes about the value

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:27.440
of different assets and the ones that he claims
