00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:33.540
So you might, if you're using a certain, uh,
asset as collateral for a loan, when you apply

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:39.349
for the loan, you claim a much higher value
to make you look like a better, uh, lending

00:02:39.349 --> 00:02:41.030
risk to the bank.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:46.890
But for tax purposes, you want to minimize
the value of that asset in order to pay less

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:51.329
in taxes that depending on how the accounting
is done and how much of that stuff is on his

00:02:51.329 --> 00:02:56.790
personal taxes anyway, you may or may not
be able to glean that from personal taxes.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:59.860
In any case, it would be indicative of a crime,
I believe.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.370
Because in New York city you're not allowed
to sort of have double books as it were, where

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.740
you value assets differently for different
purposes.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.980
According to one accountant I spoke to, but
it sort of exceeds our scope.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:14.810
And again, politically I think his followers
would just say that that's smart, that that's,

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.110
that's all that is.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:20.209
There's speculation that maybe some kind of
other crime would be exposed by Donald Trump's

00:03:20.209 --> 00:03:21.209
taxes.

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:22.209
I don't buy that at all.

00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:27.810
If Donald Trump committed crimes that are
financial crimes, um, he has his, uh, professional

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:28.810
accountants prepare taxes.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:34.359
I can't imagine that a professional accountant
would plainly expose that some kind of crime

00:03:34.359 --> 00:03:35.540
has been committed.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:39.040
There might be something that alludes to one
that would require more research and other

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.069
documents.

00:03:40.069 --> 00:03:44.480
I think at this point, the real reason Donald
Trump is still fighting this hard to hide

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:49.099
his taxes are either number one, just because
of the income net worth thing.

00:03:49.099 --> 00:03:53.670
To the extent you could glean it because of
his ego or it's just Trump doesn't want to

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.049
take the loss images.

00:03:55.049 --> 00:03:56.349
What matters to Donald Trump?

00:03:56.349 --> 00:04:02.849
If Trump wants his taxes to be private, Trump
wants to win the fight about keeping his taxes

00:04:02.849 --> 00:04:06.670
private and there's really nothing for him
to gain by releasing them.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:07.670
At this point.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.120
It is only downside risk.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:14.760
Even if we agree the risk isn't that great
that his followers would essentially justify,

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.400
rationalize anything that's in the taxes.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:22.410
It's unlikely that there is an obvious crime
in the taxes and even if there is, Trump has

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:27.430
been completely Teflon when it comes to everything
that he's done that does or potentially breaks

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.430
the law.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.720
I think now it's just downside risk.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.460
There's no advantage to releasing the taxes.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.530
Trump wants the win and that's mostly what
it is right now.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:37.949
If you have a different view, let me know.

